# Boost on 11's end save (AUTHORING.md, Boosts): party strength only, the story stays played.
# 11 ends with the lead at a third of its HP and Bite near 0 PP, and the forest has no Pokemon Center (seen: a
# whiteout in the Jack/Briana double). party-level refills HP, party-move refills Bite's PP.
party-level 0 32
party-move 0 3 MOVE_BITE
